# Keep build contexts lean and deterministic: dependencies are installed
# inside the image from the lockfile, never copied from the host — and no
# locally generated artifact may enter a layer. `out` matters beyond size:
# generation outputs and the worker's failed-generation dumps (cwd-relative
# `out/`, e.g. apps/worker/out) carry private PR/code context.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
out
**/out
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
docs
# Mirror .gitignore's secret patterns — nothing credential-shaped may enter
# an image layer (COPY . . would otherwise bake it in).
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
secrets
